# a statement a word leads with a bare word nothing defines, `on alarm {…}`, is a phrase: it brings no module defining
# the word (keys' on(key, body)), only one whose rule goes on with it (card on-alarm-keys; `warp uses` prints none)
'on alarm { 7 }; emit alarm'	7
'h = on alarm { 8 }; emit alarm'	8
